    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταψήχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rub down, pound in a mortar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				898
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wear away, consume</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος πάντα
			κ.</span> cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				176
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>crumble away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεῖ πᾶν ἄδηλον καὶ κατέψηκται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					698
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				84a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stroke, caress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					110
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκρα γενείου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.354.12
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὣς φάτο μειλιχίοισι καταψήχων ὀάροισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1102
				</span></i>
			.</div>
